  "unresolved": [
    "2026-09-20: Manufacturer catalog and current store confirm Z Moonlit. Z-labeled lateral image shows aperture ring and CLICK ON/OFF switch; manufacturer operating graphic identifies click switching. Shared E exterior also shows AF/MF and function button, but those controls were not newly asserted for Z without its opposite-side view. Z rear/underside/opposite side remain unverified. Several manufacturer detailed specification images returned 403 and store long-form images were not legible at available display scale, so existing numerical/optical, environmental, firmware, focus-mechanism and stabilization claims are retained as not fully reconfirmed rather than guessed or erased. Official comparison gives about 900 g without mount assignment; existing Z mass is retained pending Z-specific confirmation. Manufacturer packing image confirms hood, caps and soft pouch; bundled promotional UV filter does not establish permanent inclusion."
  ]
